                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2026-07-08T05:13:20Z",
                    "email": "stefan_ml@behnel.de",
                    "name": "Stefan Behnel"
                },
                "message": "[Bug] Check the list index bounds also for uniquely referenced lists. (GH-7793)\n\nIt previously crashed due to a missing bounds check when hitting the fast path of a uniquely owned list with an out-of-bounds index.\n\nThe change cleans up the semantics of the list-get-item macros to make them safer to use in the future.\n\nIssue was introduced in\nhttps://github.com/cython/cython/commit/d8071289169b3c07f6ebd7816f5a296d609b0e9c\nSee https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7011",
